                (
                    names: [
                        "--preferences",
                    ],
                    description: Some("Sets your preferences for the instance refresh so that it performs as expected when you start it. Includes the instance warmup time, the minimum and maximum healthy percentages, and the behaviors that you want Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling to use if instances that are in Standby state or protected from scale in are found. You can also choose to enable additional features, such as the following:   Auto rollback   Checkpoints   CloudWatch alarms   Skip matching   Bake time"),
